+-+--------# GL₃ Tropical Satake Classification — Definitions
+-+---+----/-- Every `(i, j)` gap with `i ∈ S`, `j ∉ S` is at least the top-k margin. -/
+-+---+----theorem topkMargin'_le_scoreGap {α : Type*} {f : α → Fin n → ℝ} {x : α}
