---------+-++/-! ## S₃-Invariant Functions (Tropical Hecke Functions) -/
---------+-++
---------+-++/-- A function f : ℤ³ → ℤ is S₃-invariant if it is invariant under
---------+-++    transposition (12) and the 3-cycle (123). -/
