++--------++    `(a, b) ↦ (a + b, b, 0)`. -/
++--------++abbrev DomWt := ℕ × ℕ
++--------++
++--------++/-- A tropical datum: a real-valued function on the dominant chamber. -/
++--------++abbrev TropDatum := DomWt → ℝ
