+----+----- -++    (μ + ν).1 = (μ.1.1 + ν.1.1, μ.1.2.1 + ν.1.2.1, μ.1.2.2 + ν.1.2.2) := rfl
+----+-------+ 
+----+-------+-end TropSatakeGL3+/-- toGL3Dom of a dominant triple returns the original triple. -/
