+---+--+-+ 
+---+--+-+-/-- Dominant coweight for GL₃ (mod center), parameterized as
+---+--+-+-    `(a, b) ↦ (a + b, b, 0)`. -/
+---+--+-+-abbrev DomWt := ℕ × ℕ
