++-+- -++# GL₃ Tropical Satake Classification — Definitions
++-+- -++
++-+- -++## Overview
++-+-@@ -5645,14 +2211,9 @@
++-+- -++
++-+- -++These conditions are shown to be mutually equivalent (up to the origin condition)
